{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743860/extras/5940af823c1cd357539677442a29f226.avif?t=1759194607\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743860/extras_big/5940af823c1cd357539677442a29f226.webp?t=1759194607 width=1560 height=867 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just wanted to rent some dvd\u2019s and ended up stranded in another world full of MONSTERS! Try to find your way back home while meeting some very curious, possibly undiagnosed neurodivergent but very cute monster girls who might help you (if they feel like it).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Monster Gals universe is created by Illustrator and Comic artist Box of Tales and this the first game featuring these characters, we hope you have fun knowing more about them.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743860/extras/fec33f387de1369bc54db89e66bd65ce.avif?t=1759194607\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743860/extras_big/fec33f387de1369bc54db89e66bd65ce.webp?t=1759194607 width=1560 height=864 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Monster Gals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ different backgrounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 routes across 10 playthroughs (3 hours to see all content)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have 562 lines of dialogue up to this point (demo)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And lots of comic style cinematics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743860/extras/a155fc95309db8a68cb414f9f3a38bb5.avif?t=1759194607\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743860/extras_big/a155fc95309